module capjustincase .
rem expect: W-EFFECT-OVER

rem ko: 나중에 쓸지도 몰라 권한과 효과를 미리 적어 두었다 /// en: the capability and the effect are declared just in case they are needed later
proc area input out cap io . input w u64 . input h u64 . output u64 . effects io .
  requires le w. 1000 . .
  requires le h. 1000 . .
do
  return mul w. h. . .
end .
